      "params": {
        "text": "Learn & Export.\n\nNIM nodes ship with fixture_mode=true (deterministic, NON-SCIENTIFIC values hashed from the input; zero network). For live scoring set fixture_mode=false and export BIONODULO_NIM_API_KEY (optional BIONODULO_NIM_BASE_URL) in the run environment; nim_test checks connectivity first.\n\nLLM design critic: provider 'custom' with api_base/model left empty resolves env defaults BIONODULO_LLM_BASE_URL (absolute http(s) URL, required for provider=custom), BIONODULO_LLM_MODEL, and the provider key env; set json_mode=false for free-form critique. The critic has no live data edges by design - it is a final report step over the documented artifacts (loop results, ensemble metrics), because wiring per-round context through the loop's single value slot would starve the policy channel.\n\nEverything in this group is continue-on-fail so a missing API key or offline environment degrades to an error output instead of a dead run."
